  Manuel Rojas Foundation. Santiago – Chile, 10th of January, 2014
  
  ---
  
  **During 2014 the Manuel Rojas Foundation has the project of opening for public consultation the valuable archive of the writer. Manuel Rojas own collections and the house in which he lived have been preserved by his family, so the Foundation will create a documentation center in order to preserve this heritage and spread his literary and intellectual legacy. (Illustration of the story _“El hombre de los ojos azules”_, Caras y Caretas Magazine – Buenos Aires, 1923).**
  
  El “Archivo Manuel Rojas”
  
  [/el-archivo-de-manuel-rojas/manuel-rojas-wartet-ich-komme-mit_1955/](![Hijo de Ladrón de Manuel Rojas, traducción al alemán.](/media/Noticias/2014JPG/Manuel-Rojas-Wartet-Ich-Komme-Mit_1955.jpg))Hijo de Ladrón – Traducción al alemán.
  
